  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"color:#f29d12;text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#fc0;text-decoration:underline\">試煉</span> </span><span style=\"color:#3cc;text-decoration:underline\">冠軍</span></span></span></span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1497/855/19511665-new-wall_xl-webp.webp\" width=\"787\" height=\"443\"></span></h1><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#ea2828\"><span style=\"color:#e82e2e\">多人 </span><span style=\"color:#d10b0b\">PvP </span><span style=\"color:#e82e2e\">小遊戲 </span></span>地圖，擁有超過 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">20 種職業</span>，每種職業都有獨特的 <span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">技能</span>、<span style=\"color:#e74c3c\">武器</span>和 <span style=\"color:#2880b9\">機制</span>可供選擇！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">在 6 個 <span style=\"color:#27ae60\">戰場</span>之一戰鬥，成為冠軍！<br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#7e8c8d\">（適用於版本 1.21.5）</span><br><br></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e52121\">新版本更新！</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#d35400\">-新增職業：</span> </span><span style=\"color:#e67e23;font-size:24px\">苦力怕、烈焰使者、蘑菇牛和雪人！</span><br><span style=\"color:#d35400;font-size:24px\">-新增 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">外觀系統！</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#d35400;font-size:24px\">-大量 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">錯誤修正與平衡調整！</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#9b59b6\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">加入我們的 Discord：</span><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/RjX9q9fhEe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2880b9\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Discord</span>.gg/RjX9q9fhEe</span></a></span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><br></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-style:italic\">現已包含自訂音樂、標題畫面等內容！</span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"> <br></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xT9qElX.gif\"></span></div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
